{"conversationId":224,"title":"Sordland/Turn10/FCAnricaDressingRoom","storyPack":"StoryPack_Main","turn":10,"turnLabel":"Turn 10","isDevNote":false,"rootNodeId":0,"nodes":{"0":{"id":0,"speaker":"Ovid Grecer","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":1}]},"1":{"id":1,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":3}]},"2":{"id":2,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":222,"nodeId":219}]},"3":{"id":3,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"I pushed open the door and stepped into the bustling locker room. The players, clad in their FC Anrica jerseys, all stopped what they were doing and turned their heads to look at me.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":4}]},"4":{"id":4,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The team's new manager, Iorgel Gloper, immediately came and shook my hand. He seemed to be under a large amount of stress.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":5}]},"5":{"id":5,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"He introduced me to the players and invited me to give a short motivational speech.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":6},{"convId":224,"nodeId":7},{"convId":224,"nodeId":8},{"convId":224,"nodeId":9}]},"6":{"id":6,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Good day to all of you, gentlemen.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":10}]},"7":{"id":7,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"FC Anrica! Your president stands together with you today.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":10}]},"8":{"id":8,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Hello, everybody. I hope you are ready for the match of the decade!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":10}]},"9":{"id":9,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"It's great to be here today among all of you.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":10}]},"10":{"id":10,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"A hush fell over the room as the players leaned forward, eagerly awaiting my words.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":11},{"convId":224,"nodeId":12},{"convId":224,"nodeId":13}]},"11":{"id":11,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Today, we stand united on this hallowed ground, representing our nation, our flag, and the hopes of millions.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":17},{"convId":224,"nodeId":16},{"convId":224,"nodeId":18}]},"12":{"id":12,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Today, you have one purpose. You are here to win, to show the world the Sordish spirit. And I know that you will succeed.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":14}]},"13":{"id":13,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"I want you to know that millions are proud of you for reaching this stage in the Merkopan Cup. Regardless of the results, your achievements so far will not be forgotten.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":15}]},"14":{"id":14,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":17},{"convId":224,"nodeId":16},{"convId":224,"nodeId":18}]},"15":{"id":15,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":17},{"convId":224,"nodeId":16},{"convId":224,"nodeId":18}]},"16":{"id":16,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"This match is more than a game. It's an opportunity to showcase the strength, resilience, and spirit of both FC Anrica and the country of Sordland.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":20}]},"17":{"id":17,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Every pass, every tackle, every goal must be executed with the utmost precision, for the eyes of the world and the Sordish people are upon us.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":19}]},"18":{"id":18,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"This match is a celebration, an opportunity to showcase the true essence of your craft. Let's take a moment to breathe in the electric atmosphere, to soak in the vibrant energy that surrounds you.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":23},{"convId":224,"nodeId":22},{"convId":224,"nodeId":21}]},"19":{"id":19,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":23},{"convId":224,"nodeId":22},{"convId":224,"nodeId":21}]},"20":{"id":20,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":23},{"convId":224,"nodeId":22},{"convId":224,"nodeId":21}]},"21":{"id":21,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"You have inspired millions of Sordish men and women. Their hopes and dreams rest on what happens in the next 90 minutes.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":26}]},"22":{"id":22,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"We must push ourselves beyond our limits, embracing discomfort and adversity as catalysts for our growth.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":25}]},"23":{"id":23,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"As you step onto that field, let go of any lingering doubts and embrace the sheer joy that comes with playing the game you love dearly.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":24}]},"24":{"id":24,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":27},{"convId":224,"nodeId":28},{"convId":224,"nodeId":29}]},"25":{"id":25,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":27},{"convId":224,"nodeId":28},{"convId":224,"nodeId":29}]},"26":{"id":26,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":27},{"convId":224,"nodeId":28},{"convId":224,"nodeId":29}]},"27":{"id":27,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"I don't want to see any regrets after the match. You've got to leave everything out there on the field.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":32}]},"28":{"id":28,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Failure is not an option, for it will reverberate through the annals of history. I implore you to dig deep within your souls, find that reservoir of untapped determination, and channel it into every fiber of your being.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":31}]},"29":{"id":29,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Remember, it's not just about the outcome, but the memories we create and the smiles we bring to the faces of our fans.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":30}]},"30":{"id":30,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":33},{"convId":224,"nodeId":34},{"convId":224,"nodeId":35}]},"31":{"id":31,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":33},{"convId":224,"nodeId":34},{"convId":224,"nodeId":35}]},"32":{"id":32,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":33},{"convId":224,"nodeId":34},{"convId":224,"nodeId":35}]},"33":{"id":33,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"You are an extraordinary team. The best in Sordland. Maybe even the best in Merkopa.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":37},{"convId":224,"nodeId":38},{"convId":224,"nodeId":39}]},"34":{"id":34,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"The weight of this moment may feel overwhelming, but it is in the crucible of pressure that true champions are forged.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":36}]},"35":{"id":35,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"When the final whistle blows, we want to look back and know that we gave it our all.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 1"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":37},{"convId":224,"nodeId":38},{"convId":224,"nodeId":39}]},"36":{"id":36,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":37},{"convId":224,"nodeId":38},{"convId":224,"nodeId":39}]},"37":{"id":37,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"The match today will not be easy. But neither was the path that led to it. I am proud of each and every one of you.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":42},{"convId":224,"nodeId":46},{"convId":224,"nodeId":47},{"convId":224,"nodeId":48}]},"38":{"id":38,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Now, go forth, my fellow Anrican warriors, and leave an indelible mark on this game! I have the utmost faith in your success!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":41}]},"39":{"id":39,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Now take a moment to relax. And don't forget -- win or lose, Sordland is proud of you.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":40}]},"40":{"id":40,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":42},{"convId":224,"nodeId":46},{"convId":224,"nodeId":47},{"convId":224,"nodeId":48}]},"41":{"id":41,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":42},{"convId":224,"nodeId":46},{"convId":224,"nodeId":47},{"convId":224,"nodeId":48}]},"42":{"id":42,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Long live the Republic and long live Sordland!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":50}]},"43":{"id":43,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":44},{"convId":224,"nodeId":45}]},"44":{"id":44,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] <= 5  and  Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] >= 1","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"<=","value":"5"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":">=","value":"1"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":56}]},"45":{"id":45,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] <= 5  and  Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] >= 1) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"<=","value":"5"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":">=","value":"1"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":57}]},"46":{"id":46,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"All together now. Eye to eye, tooth to tooth! FC Anrica!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":52}]},"47":{"id":47,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Just know this... If you fail at this stage, you'll be proving me wrong. Nobody wants that. Are we clear, gentlemen? Are you ready to win?\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":51}]},"48":{"id":48,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"A Morgna wes core!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] - 2"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":49}]},"49":{"id":49,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.AMorgnaWesCore","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.AMorgnaWesCore\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":54}]},"50":{"id":50,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The players exchanged puzzled looks for a few seconds before they broke into loud applause.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":55}]},"51":{"id":51,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":53}]},"52":{"id":52,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"All of them stood up and yelled \"Champion FC Anrica!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":43}]},"53":{"id":53,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The players exchanged nervous glances. Their captain gestured at them, and they burst into loud applause.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] + 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":43}]},"54":{"id":54,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Most of the team shouted back the phrase: \"Vectern sis da!\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.AMorgnaWesCore","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.AMorgnaWesCore\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":55}]},"55":{"id":55,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"I cast my eyes over the team. The Sordish players were grinning, but others seemed unconvinced.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":43}]},"56":{"id":56,"speaker":"Paskal Beniwoll","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnrica_Wins","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":57}]},"57":{"id":57,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Just then, the legendary Sordish defender, Captain Bruno Korkmer, came up to me and explained that he and his family had voted for me.","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] <= 5  and  Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] >= 1) and ((Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] <= 5  and  Variable[\"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress\"] >= 1) == false)","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":"<=","value":"5"},{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnricaTeamSpeech_Stress","op":">=","value":"1"}],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameIsolated.FCAnrica_Wins","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":58}]},"58":{"id":58,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"He then introduced me to the two newest transfers to the team, already considered the star duo of FC Anrica -- the Neqisi midfielder Hsuen Xoqr and the Nibiyan striker Leon al-Ogwaldo.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":59}]},"59":{"id":59,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"They both shook my hand and greeted me in broken Sordish.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":60}]},"60":{"id":60,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Right after that, the manager signalled to the players that the match was about to begin. The security staff ushered me back towards the lounge.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":224,"nodeId":2}]}}}